body.p:
The loss of the division, I regret to inform you, is heavy.

It went into action 4,541 strong, of whom 6 officers and 84 enlisted men were killed, 33 officers and 558 enlisted men wounded, and 58 enlisted men missing, making a total loss of 739;



But see revised statement, p. 106. more than half of which occurred in Hazen's brigade.

div.p:
A field return of the force carried into action, marked A; 



Not found. a return of killed, wounded, and missing, marked B, and the reports of division commanders, marked C and D,



Nos. 167 and 190. accompanied by those of subordinate commanders, are herewith forwarded.
